        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "scj7",
          "text": "Despite a litany of objections by Mr. Gauthier and numerous unfavorable rulings by the court, the jury returned a verdict for the plaintiff in the amount of $11,990.03. After the addition of interest and costs, the award will be approximately 15 times Allstate’s initial offer of settlement and almost double its final offer before trial.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
