      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "scjc",
          "text": "“We believed in our client and we wanted a much bigger win,” said Sean after the verdict, “but it feels really good to have a jury find for us in the face of so many obstacles. We owe a lot to our co-workers, friends, and family for helping us so much in getting ready.”",
